# Review 2026-11-06 — proposed, nothing landed: five brace decisions for the creator, five slices that wait on nothing (pins, the cauldron's write-back, the paren fallback, the wall aliases, the element pair), then one serializer, the `< & >` instrument and a home door.
# Plan Index — brace-semantics
#
# Status 2026-11-06. No slice landed; each brace pair now names its slot wherever it sits (creator, 2026-11-05). Five slices wait on nothing.

